PackageName: tafas
License: MIT
ShortDescription: Fetch a video from YouTube, TikTok or X as one playable MP4.
Description: Tafas picks a format, fetches it, verifies it and renames it into place atomically. Picture and sound are copied, never re-encoded, and no external program is run. A capability it lacks is reported by name instead of being skipped silently.
